      "cannot_verify_reason": null,
      "evidence_summary": "The only linkage performed is one Homborsund opening to NVDB (Table 5). The housing-listing data are not linked to the database. Equations (1)–(2) are proposed, not estimated. Section 8 says \"several steps remain before the database can be used for causal research\", including a larger validation sample, automated grouping and matching, and the systematic NVDB comparison. The conclusion's phrase is conditional ('can support') but gives no indication of these limits. It also says nothing about the selection and description biases the literature review concedes for newspaper data.",
