    {
      "id": "CONSIST-007",
      "category": "abstract_overstatement",
      "finding_summary": "The abstract says linking one opening to NVDB 'shows that the articles add an exact opening date, which NVDB lacks', generalising from a single Homborsund case, while Section 8 lists the systematic comparison with NVDB dates as future work.",
